{"product_id":"practical-iridology-and-sclerology","title":"Practical Iridology and Sclerology","description":"\u003cp\u003e\"The eye is the window to the body and soul.\" This observation is the basis of Dr. Bamer's latest book, Practical Iridology and Sclerology. Dr. Bamer's expert knowledge of the eye shows through in this easy-to-understand and practical refrence guide, making it a must for the beginning and experienced iridologist\/sclerologist. Complete with color photo case studies, outlines on all the iris and scleral signs, and iridology and sclerology charts, Practical Iridology and Sclerology provides a comprehensive look at a valuable diagnostic practice.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 140 x 216\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Donald R. Bamer\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781885670021\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 216\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45297451335833,"sku":"10RC9781885670021","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/PracticalIridologyandSclerologyDonaldR.Bamer.jpg?v=1744480523","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/practical-iridology-and-sclerology","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}